  "content": "<a href=\"/#portofolio\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>Social Media Design</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Social Media Design</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Making scroll-stopping content that feels on-brand and looks clean.<br data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"273\" />I design layouts for Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok — anything from carousels to reels to promo posts. My goal? Eye-catching, easy-to-read visuals that match your vibe and make people wanna click.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>📂 <strong data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"288\">Content Categories</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCarousel Content\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPromotional Posts\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReels / Shorts Visual\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBranding Templates\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>📺 Media</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLinkedin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d6a105b\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"215\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTYwLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wva2hhaXJhbi50ZWNoXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI1XC8wNlwvMjE1LndlYnAiLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiJkNmExMDViIn0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/215.webp\"><figure><img s