trong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tVisual Composition\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tTypography &amp; Color Theory\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tStrategic Messaging\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tPlatform Optimization\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🎯 <strong data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1458\">Design Purpose</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1311\"><li data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1074\"><p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1074\">Create content that’s not only visually appealing but also tailored to specific platform formats and user behavior.</p></li><li data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1154\"><p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1154\">Strengthen brand consistency and recognition through every visual element.</p></li><li data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1228\"><p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1228\">Help businesses communicate complex ideas in a simple, engaging way.</p></li><li data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1311\"><p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1311\">Increase audience retention and interactions with data-backed design decisions.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1316\" />"
